.TH USELIB 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
uselib \- invoke the obsolete Linux shared-library loader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/legacy_syscalls.h>
.B int uselib(const char* path);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the obsolete Linux shared-library loader. Availability depends on
the kernel's CONFIG_USELIB option; kernels without it return ENOSYS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR uselib (2)
